773
40:43.310 --> 40:44.310
Oh...

774
40:44.710 --> 40:45.510
Yes.

775
40:50.310 --> 40:51.310
Want some?

776
40:54.310 --> 40:55.220
Whoa.

777
40:55.250 --> 40:56.200
Thank you.

778
41:04.310 --> 41:06.110
Let me know if you need any help.

779
41:08.310 --> 41:09.170
Oh.

780
41:09.300 --> 41:11.500
It's okay.

781
41:11.900 --> 41:13.610
Chew it properly. I'm not in a hurry.

782
41:18.590 --> 41:20.210
I'm Bew's assistant.

783
41:21.410 --> 41:22.410
Oh.

784
41:22.910 --> 41:23.880
So you're Jane?

785
41:24.750 --> 41:26.560
We're working on the same project, right?

786
41:26.890 --> 41:27.730
Right.

787
41:27.920 --> 41:28.700
Perfect.

788
41:33.010 --> 41:33.810
Jaab.

789
41:34.000 --> 41:34.730
Hm?

790
41:35.320 --> 41:36.600
Today marks...

791
41:37.300 --> 41:39.200
my first month of working here.

792
41:39.750 --> 41:41.340
The seniors evaluated my performance.

793
41:41.360 --> 41:42.360
Mm.

794
41:42.490 --> 41:45.510
Their feedback was that I wasn't communicative enough.

795
41:45.530 --> 41:46.280
Oh.

796
41:46.800 --> 41:47.900
Who said that?

797
41:48.300 --> 41:49.700
You can tell me.

798
41:49.900 --> 41:51.210
I'll handle them for you.

799
41:54.410 --> 41:55.920
Maybe it was you?

800
41:56.410 --> 41:57.000
Hm?

801
41:58.300 --> 41:59.570
You can be honest with me.

802
41:59.590 --> 42:00.700
I won't get mad.

803
42:00.720 --> 42:02.280
So I can improve myself.

804
42:02.510 --> 42:03.510
Gosh, Jane.

805
42:04.000 --> 42:05.000
It wasn't me.

806
42:06.600 --> 42:07.600
No...?

807
42:09.110 --> 42:11.910
But I'm very sure that it was you, Jaab.

808
42:12.110 --> 42:13.670
Come on, Jane. Why would you...

809
42:16.100 --> 42:17.110
Just chew it first.

810
42:17.540 --> 42:18.300
Jane.

811
42:18.720 --> 42:20.000
Why would you think that?

812
42:20.020 --> 42:21.320
It wasn't me.

813
42:24.200 --> 42:25.200
Really.

814
42:29.810 --> 42:30.720
Mm.

815
42:34.310 --> 42:36.280
You always talk while chewing food.

816
42:36.300 --> 42:37.310
You might choke.

817
42:43.410 --> 42:44.410
By the way,

818
42:44.600 --> 42:46.370
why would you think that...

819
42:46.400 --> 42:48.010
I was the one who told the seniors?

820
42:49.500 --> 42:50.500
I'm not sure.

821
42:50.990 --> 42:52.240
We sit next to each other.

822
42:52.920 --> 42:55.200
You talk to everyone, but not to me.

823
42:55.400 --> 42:57.490
So I thought it was you.

824
42:58.120 --> 43:00.000
You were the one who wouldn't talk to me.

825
43:01.210 --> 43:02.610
I tried.

826
43:03.200 --> 43:05.800
But starting a conversation with strangers

827
43:06.300 --> 43:08.890
is way harder than growing mangoes from a durian tree.

828
43:11.040 --> 43:12.600
What an analogy.

829
43:12.890 --> 43:16.250
You're tiny, but you've got a great vocab in that head of yours, huh?

830
43:18.820 --> 43:19.820
Well...

831
43:21.530 --> 43:23.880
I'm sorry for misunderstanding you.

832
43:24.800 --> 43:25.760
Right now,

833
43:26.020 --> 43:27.170
we've grown closer.

834
43:28.410 --> 43:31.100
Now I know that you're not a tattletale.

835
43:35.310 --> 43:36.690
So we've...

836
43:38.600 --> 43:39.540
we've grown closer now?

837
43:40.720 --> 43:42.130
I don't know if it's the same for you,

838
43:42.150 --> 43:43.620
but for me,

839
43:43.820 --> 43:44.890
I see you

840
43:45.740 --> 43:47.410
as a very close friend of mine.

841
43:50.810 --> 43:51.810
Oh...

842
43:52.080 --> 43:53.010
Really?

843
43:53.200 --> 43:53.820
Mm.

844
43:54.320 --> 43:55.320
That's great.

845
44:01.040 --> 44:02.040
And...

846
44:02.400 --> 44:04.300
where are you getting your ideas from?

847
44:09.300 --> 44:10.300
- Jaab? - Whoa!

848
44:12.460 --> 44:14.310
I said where are you getting your ideas from?

849
44:14.540 --> 44:15.410
Oh.

850
44:15.890 --> 44:16.670
Well...

851
44:16.810 --> 44:18.590
The mood of the song is very sad,

852
44:18.610 --> 44:20.100
so I want the location to be like

853
44:20.320 --> 44:22.200
somewhere in the woods or up in the mountains

854
44:22.220 --> 44:24.370
with some fog and stuff.

855
44:24.710 --> 44:25.710
And...

856
44:26.500 --> 44:27.690
I want somewhere that feels

857
44:28.410 --> 44:29.410
lonely and isolated.

858
44:33.100 --> 44:34.100
How about Phetchabun?

859
44:34.900 --> 44:35.590
Hm?

860
44:36.310 --> 44:38.810
That sounds alright. Maybe a place like Khao Kho will do.

861
44:38.830 --> 44:41.240
It's a good pick, too. We don't have to fly there.

862
44:41.310 --> 44:42.600
That would be a waste of our budget.

863
44:44.920 --> 44:47.910
How about a place located before Khao Kho...

864
44:47.930 --> 44:49.110
but very close to it?

865
44:50.510 --> 44:51.510
What do you mean?

866
44:52.200 --> 44:53.280
You can visit my house.

867
44:53.400 --> 44:54.100
Huh?!

868
44:54.610 --> 44:56.200
My house there has a lot of isolated corners.

869
45:17.890 --> 45:18.890
Jane.

870
45:19.590 --> 45:20.520
Are you leaving soon?

871
45:21.100 --> 45:22.100
In a bit.

872
45:32.390 --> 45:34.480
Maybe it's time you get a haircut.

873
45:37.410 --> 45:39.100
I'm planning to get one before going home.

874
45:39.600 --> 45:40.600
Mm.

875
45:45.650 --> 45:46.390
Jane.

876
45:46.410 --> 45:47.310
Hm?

877
45:49.000 --> 45:51.270
Can I really go there?

878
45:53.260 --> 45:54.080
Go where?

879
45:54.640 --> 45:55.500
Well...

880
45:55.900 --> 45:57.190
To your house.

881
45:58.720 --> 45:59.720
Mm.

882
46:00.200 --> 46:01.280
Yes, you can.

883
46:12.700 --> 46:14.290
This is my garden house.

884
46:14.510 --> 46:16.770
Take a look and see...

885
46:16.800 --> 46:18.180
if the vibe is right for you.

886
46:18.420 --> 46:19.590
Sheesh.

887
46:20.290 --> 46:22.360
You looked up your own house on a website?

888
46:22.710 --> 46:24.310
Wait, what...

889
46:24.790 --> 46:26.220
What kind of family are you from?

890
46:27.400 --> 46:28.160
Jeez.

891
46:28.180 --> 46:30.000
My dad made it.

892
46:30.310 --> 46:32.810
It hasn't been updated often, though.

893
46:32.830 --> 46:33.570
- Anyway... - Mm.

894
46:33.620 --> 46:35.600
Take a look before you make your decision.

895
46:36.020 --> 46:37.020
Oh...

896
46:37.500 --> 46:39.010
Okay, okay.

897
46:39.690 --> 46:41.120
Excuse me, Jane.

898
46:42.510 --> 46:44.000
Whoa, Jane...

899
46:44.020 --> 46:45.780
This is truly something else.

900
46:45.800 --> 46:47.510
[Cozy Camping House Compilation for the Outdoorsy]

901
47:16.110 --> 47:17.110
Whoa...

902
47:17.130 --> 47:19.430
Does the entire property belong to your family?

903
47:20.000 --> 47:21.320
- Yeah. - This one, too?

904
47:22.020 --> 47:23.020
Whoa...

905
47:23.710 --> 47:24.650
What?

906
47:59.500 --> 48:00.400
Hm?

907
48:09.100 --> 48:10.840
No, it's... It's nothing.

908
48:17.910 --> 48:19.290
I'm going to refill my cup.

909
48:19.510 --> 48:20.920
You want a drink?

910
48:22.400 --> 48:23.400
I'm good.

911
48:27.300 --> 48:28.280
What is it, Jaab?

912
48:28.630 --> 48:29.630
Uh...

913
48:31.000 --> 48:33.680
Jane, you did such an amazing job.

914
48:33.700 --> 48:36.490
You're working all alone late at night.

915
48:36.510 --> 48:37.950
Gosh, you're such a sweetheart.

916
48:37.970 --> 48:39.890
- You deserve a reward. - Ow, Jaab.

917
48:39.910 --> 48:41.110
What's up with you?

918
48:41.690 --> 48:42.880
Move. I need a drink.

919
48:54.200 --> 48:55.610
I'm screwed.

920
49:08.610 --> 49:10.520
What are you trying to pull now?

921
49:10.920 --> 49:12.190
Uh...

922
49:12.300 --> 49:13.400
Well...

923
49:14.210 --> 49:16.080
I'm...

924
49:17.820 --> 49:18.880
I'm sorry.

925
49:20.490 --> 49:21.550
Whoa, Jaab!

926
49:23.190 --> 49:24.490
What are you doing?

927
49:24.510 --> 49:25.470
Get away from me.

928
49:32.600 --> 49:35.780
I'm such a mess. Damn it.

929
49:56.800 --> 49:57.800
Here I go.

930
49:57.900 --> 49:58.900
Jaab.

931
49:59.020 --> 50:00.680
You've got this. You can do this...

932
50:00.790 --> 50:02.510
Right, I'm all done now.

933
50:02.530 --> 50:03.790
Let me pack up my stuff real quick.

934
50:04.520 --> 50:06.080
Oh, okay.

935
50:06.590 --> 50:07.590
Okay...

936
50:08.910 --> 50:10.120
Jaab...

937
50:10.140 --> 50:11.110
You've got this.

938
50:11.130 --> 50:12.490
I'm totally screwed.

939
50:16.390 --> 50:17.290
[AirDrop: Jaab would like to send you a photo]

940
50:18.510 --> 50:19.990
I'm totally screwed...

941
50:20.490 --> 50:22.310
I'm screwed.

942
50:23.910 --> 50:24.910
Oh, my God...

943
50:30.520 --> 50:31.400
Jane.

944
50:31.760 --> 50:33.280
I'm... I'm so sorry, Jane.

945
50:33.390 --> 50:34.600
I didn't mean to do it.

946
50:34.620 --> 50:35.710
It was an accident.

947
50:35.960 --> 50:37.310
We can fix this.

948
50:37.330 --> 50:38.390
- I'll... - Jaab!

949
50:38.420 --> 50:40.130
- Jane, Jane, Jane. - Why are you like this?

950
50:40.160 --> 50:42.290
- It hurts, it hurts. - You're so mean. Come here.

951
50:42.510 --> 50:43.620
- Jane, calm down. - Why are you like this?

952
50:43.640 --> 50:44.670
Stop, stop, stop.

953
50:44.690 --> 50:45.860
I'll give you a makeover.

954
50:45.880 --> 50:47.640
Jane, calm down, Jane!

955
50:56.920 --> 50:57.900
Jane...

956
50:57.920 --> 50:59.240
Please forgive me, Jane.

957
50:59.260 --> 51:00.770
I didn't mean to do it.

958
51:00.790 --> 51:02.080
Jane...

959
51:03.510 --> 51:04.790
I'm sorry.

960
51:05.620 --> 51:07.800
Why did you scribble stuff on my forehead?

961
51:08.100 --> 51:09.480
You had nothing else to do?

962
51:11.680 --> 51:13.360
Oh, Jane...

963
51:13.390 --> 51:16.930
Who in their right mind would randomly write things on people's foreheads?

964
51:17.290 --> 51:19.080
Someone like you, Jaab.

965
51:23.020 --> 51:26.270
I told you I was going to fix your hair.

966
51:27.510 --> 51:28.350
You...

967
51:28.380 --> 51:29.620
You're being nosy.

968
51:30.000 --> 51:31.000
Alright, alright.

969
51:31.600 --> 51:32.670
I'm nosy, alright.

970
51:32.690 --> 51:34.680
Let me wipe your face clean.

971
51:34.700 --> 51:35.550
Check this out.

972
51:35.620 --> 51:37.690
I stole this cleanser from Bew.

973
51:37.710 --> 51:38.630
How about that?

974
51:38.650 --> 51:39.880
Jaab, you brat.

975
51:40.400 --> 51:41.400
What?

976
51:41.720 --> 51:42.990
Come on, Jane.

977
51:43.010 --> 51:44.400
That's a bit harsh, isn't it?

978
51:56.990 --> 51:58.610
Come here...

979
51:58.630 --> 52:01.300
I'll wipe them off, and your forehead will be as good as new.

980
52:01.910 --> 52:02.410
Come here.

981
52:02.710 --> 52:03.620
No.

982
52:04.500 --> 52:05.510
Just a quick wipe.

983
52:05.530 --> 52:06.400
No...

984
52:11.390 --> 52:12.390
Here.

985
52:14.010 --> 52:16.750
I'm feeling guilty, so I'm trying to be responsible.

986
52:18.220 --> 52:19.520
Hold still.

987
52:19.540 --> 52:21.110
I'll wipe them off for you.

988
52:23.520 --> 52:26.480
You see... Your hair is too long.

989
52:26.510 --> 52:29.470
It was getting in your eyes, so I wanted to brush it away.

990
52:29.490 --> 52:31.530
How did that even bother you?

991
52:32.000 --> 52:33.900
It did bother me, because I was looking...

992
52:34.910 --> 52:38.320
It happens on its own without an explanation.

993
52:38.590 --> 52:41.040
There's no exact science behind it. No rules set in stone.

994
52:41.070 --> 52:42.800
It's like an eruption in my heart.

995
52:45.790 --> 52:49.520
It simply feels just right...

996
52:50.730 --> 52:52.110
It feels good to be around each other.

997
52:53.100 --> 52:54.230
Really good...

998
52:56.100 --> 52:57.680
There's no way to control

999
52:58.230 --> 53:00.090
the chemistry between two people.

1000
53:07.500 --> 53:08.610
That's such a small bag.

1001
53:08.630 --> 53:10.610
Mine looks over-prepared compared to yours.

1002
53:10.640 --> 53:12.490
You're preparing to stay at another place.

1003
53:12.530 --> 53:13.840
But that other place is my home.

1004
53:13.970 --> 53:15.340
Don't pretend to act tough.

1005
53:15.360 --> 53:18.330
I know how much this trip makes your heart quiver.

1006
53:18.400 --> 53:20.800
I'm working at my second big company,

1007
53:20.840 --> 53:22.320
and I found myself a close friend.

1008
53:22.450 --> 53:23.760
His name is Jaab.

1009
53:24.060 --> 53:26.810
What brings your friend here

1010
53:26.830 --> 53:28.640
on the same trip?

1011
53:28.660 --> 53:29.790
His name is Jaab,

1012
53:29.920 --> 53:30.860
my colleague.

1013
53:30.880 --> 53:33.440
I've grown close to him before I knew it.

1014
53:33.460 --> 53:35.480
Will Jane know that I like him?

1015
53:35.600 --> 53:37.110
If he finds out and hates me,

1016
53:37.130 --> 53:38.200
what should I do?

1017
53:38.420 --> 53:40.510
Become his boyfriend first, my guy.

1018
53:40.530 --> 53:41.620
Don't jump the gun.

1019
53:41.790 --> 53:42.510
Jaab.

1020
53:43.100 --> 53:43.730
Jane.

1021
53:44.290 --> 53:45.790
I...
